Merges jedida-integration-branch-full-repo.zip into the current
repository: unified financial ledger, provider/method abstraction,
Financial Control Center, packaging evidence (with chat-link column),
POS (ledger-integrated, with client_sale_uuid idempotency + offline
queue), wallet (fixed deposit/transfer idempotency), Live Shopping
(Cloudflare Stream-backed, with ported moderation tables), Go chat
engine (services/go-services, cmd/chat only), Wanted redesign,
profile identity rebuild, dead-route cleanup, and partial emoji/icon
cleanup on admin + chat surfaces.

- Cleaned malformed brace-expansion junk directory under
  services/live-go/{cmd,... before copying (empty, no files lost).
- .env files (root/backend/frontend) were not touched.
- No existing files were deleted; 39 new files, 61 modified.
- Migrations schema_phase94-101 are additive only, correctly ordered.
- Syntax-validated: all changed backend .js (node --check) and
  frontend .js/.jsx (esbuild) files parse cleanly. No Go toolchain
  available in this sandbox — Go files checked for package decls
  and balanced braces only, not compiled.
- Not pushed; no remote configured in this sandbox.
